This project reimplements and organizes a manual EMRT/RL statistical arbitrage
implementation inspired by:

  Boming Ning and Kiseop Lee,
  "Advanced Statistical Arbitrage with Reinforcement Learning",
  February 26, 2024.

The paper is credited as the methodological source. This repository does not
redistribute the paper PDF by default. Public references:

  arXiv: https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.12180
  SSRN:  https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=4739373

The local implementation is distributed under the MIT License.

